WEBVTT

00:17.060 --> 00:25.084
Sometimes I look at the lines on your face And I

00:25.184 --> 00:33.928
see all the years in this terrible place I know

00:34.008 --> 00:42.932
what it cost you to stay by my side The pieces of

00:43.092 --> 00:47.730
you that you're Trying to hide

00:51.111 --> 00:54.152
Don't talk like it's a burden

00:56.593 --> 01:03.755
I didn't choose There's nothing about you I'm

01:03.995 --> 01:11.688
willing to lose It's heavy, it's hard And it

01:11.828 --> 01:17.269
breaks me apart But it's the only thing keeping a

01:17.649 --> 01:27.792
beat in my heart The weight we carry is pulling us

01:27.952 --> 01:35.894
down But we're holding our breath so we never

01:35.934 --> 01:44.576
drown It's a beautiful anchor A terrible shame

01:45.976 --> 01:52.458
It's the love that we found at the end of the pain

01:53.758 --> 02:02.200
We won't let it fall We won't let it go It's the

02:02.520 --> 02:08.022
only gravity we'll ever know

02:22.425 --> 02:31.140
I hate that you can't have a life of your own I hate

02:31.180 --> 02:40.083
that I need you to not be you My life is right here

02:40.183 --> 02:44.185
in the dark of this room We're flowers that only

02:44.285 --> 02:48.728
know how to bloom In the shade of each other away

02:48.828 --> 02:53.610
from the sun When the rest of the world is all said

02:53.750 --> 03:00.534
and done The weight we carry Is pulling us down

03:02.175 --> 03:03.996
But we're holding our breath

03:10.202 --> 03:18.310
It's a beautiful anchor, a terrible chain It's

03:18.370 --> 03:26.177
the love that we found at the end of the pain We

03:26.197 --> 03:36.173
won't let it fall, we won't let it go It's the only

03:36.413 --> 03:40.335
gravity we'll ever know

03:43.977 --> 03:44.938
It's heavy

03:47.619 --> 03:52.822
But I'm here I'm not going anywhere

